          <rdf:li>modern but everyone still has their powers</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sports</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>everyone has healthy relationships with their parents!</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver is a pompous art teacher</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>the whole cast makes an appearance</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora-centric (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Everyone Is Gay</rdf:li>
